<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Progressive Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Progressive Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Progressive Corp with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- said innovative distribution strategy should enable company to lower its costs and take market share.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $90.</p>
</text>
